  <name>Bitwarden Password Manager</name>
  <summary>Secure your digital life</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Bitwarden is an open source password manager that secures your accounts
      and protects from hackers and data breaches. Generate, save, and
      autofill strong passwords for every account on every device.
    </p>
    <p>
      Keep passwords, passkeys, cards, secure notes, SSH keys, and identities
      in an end-to-end encrypted vault that syncs across your phone, tablet,
      computer, and every major browser.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Autofill logins and passkeys</li>
      <li>Generate strong passwords, usernames, and email aliases</li>
      <li>Share logins with family or friends, or send encrypted text through a secure link</li>
      <li>Store unlimited passwords and sync across unlimited devices</li>
      <li>Choose between cloud or self-host deployments</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Bitwarden code is open source and can be viewed by anyone. Third-party
      security audits are published annually.
    </p>
  </description>
